+# Process audit — S5-CLM-00003579
+
+This target is the sole owner of `Erdos1028.erdos_1028` and uses the frozen
+record `ea27c18c18c8eada2b5e051b2f365c2d558ec0f6ebc366eaab84bbb522fdfbb6`.
+The task-local process followed the immutable checklist in order:
+
+1. INTAKE bound the FC-SORRY record, source revision, and Stage6 alias.
+2. STATEMENT recorded the exact source type and a claim-owned transport
+   surface.  The numeric provider module is retained in a provenance comment;
+   the executable import is `Mathlib`.
+3. ANCHOR made the source byte range and target fragment content-addressed.
+4. TREE recorded a typed, acyclic proof/composition/provenance DAG.
+5. MACHINE recorded the semantic environment, root expression, empty axiom
+   census, and trust-zero cold-replay requirements.
+6. READABLE supplied a total injective node-to-fragment map with reverse
+   coverage and two independent reviewer identities.
+7. VALIDATE ran the task-local semantic preflight with `--no-lean`.
+8. RELEASE emitted a provisional candidate only; canonical Master acceptance
+   remains false and is intentionally outside worker authority.
+
+No canonical repository path, predecessor generation, sibling task root,
+network resource, Lean/Lake/Elan process, or shared writable state was used.
+The worker did not edit the Blueprint, catalog, aggregator, or any authority
+receipt.  All source and declaration hashes above are copied from the pinned
+bootstrap workset and are independently rechecked by the validator.
+
+## Trust boundaries
+
+The provider contributes statement bytes only.  The worker package contributes
+transport/evidence claims, never a provider proof body.  The Master must
+recompute elaborated expressions, transitive constants, exact M0 closure,
+semantic-substitution mutations, and cold from-source replay before changing
+the provisional decision.
